    {o:["I was watching TV when the phone rang.","I were watching TV when the phone rang.","I am watching TV when the phone rang."],w:"An action going on in the past takes was / were + V-ing. “I” takes was.",c:7},
    {o:["They were playing when it started to rain.","They was playing when it started to rain.","They are playing when it started to rain."],w:"Past continuous with a plural subject: were playing.",c:7},
    {o:["At this time tomorrow, I will be flying to Delhi.","At this time tomorrow, I was flying to Delhi.","At this time tomorrow, I will flying to Delhi."],w:"Future continuous: will be + V-ing.",c:7},
